      "Name": "Predictive Studio Gates — Monitoring",
      "Description": "The monitoring gates (PR 4 M6): G6.1 (closed-window predictions joined to outcomes), G6.2 (per-period RMSE with bounds), G6.3/G6.4/G6.5 (retrain triggers fire on realised performance only), G6.7 (tracked positive rate from labels), G6.9/G6.10/G6.11 (challengers paired on the incumbent's rows, published only on evidence) and G6.12 (parity catches a 1e-6 skew). Each member's MaxExecutionTimeMS is set from its measured run. Needs MJAPI (STORAGE_LOCAL_ROOT set, PREDICTIVE_STUDIO_SIDECAR_URL at the truth sidecar), the truth sidecar running and `pnpm run truth:provision` done. Run with: MJ_INTEGRATION_TEST=1 RUN_MUTATION_TESTS=1 pnpm mj test suite \"Predictive Studio Gates — Monitoring\"",
